  "description": "How would you feel if you were given the opportunity to nab the house of your dreams? Yeonju and Jihun are given that exact chance, and it seems a waste to turn it down. There’s only one catch...to get that house, they have to get married! Being staunch advocates of the single life, the two of them come up with a plan. Will their fake marriage successfully fool everyone? More importantly, will they be able to keep the relationship strictly business-like? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
